OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to 'devoted' dad who
OL,4,Adied in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamily and colleagues of a '"devoted"
OL,7,Fand "hard working" husband, father and
OL,8,Fson have paid tribute to him after he
OL,9,Fdied in a crash in Shropshire.
OL,11,FKuljit Singh Uppal, 39, from Telford,
OL,12,Fdied on Tuesday 11 August after a car
OL,13,Fcrashed into a tractor on the A41 near
OL,14,FNewport. He died at the scene, said
OL,15,Fpolice.
OL,17,FHis family described him as someone who
OL,18,Fworked "incredibly hard" and spoke of
OL,19,Fthe "devastating loss" his death had
OL,20,Fbrought.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
